  "headingOutline": [
    "H1: Generate measurable value with Data Science & Analytics.",
    "H2: Why Data Science & Analytics matters.",
    "H2: Release value faster through iterative Data Science & Analytics.",
    "H2: Data expertise that's relied on by the world's best-run companies.",
    "H3: Building a live data solution for Anglian Water's storm response.",
    "H2: Meet the Aiimi experts.",
    "H2: Discover more data solutions.",
    "H2: Talk to us about Data Science & Analytics."
  ],
  "bodyText": "Generate measurable value with Data Science & Analytics.\n\nFind signals in complex data and accelerate strategic objectives, with expert consulting in Data Science & Analytics.\n\nTalk to us\nWhy Data Science & Analytics matters.\n\nWithout data science, your data is unintelligible. Important patterns and behaviours are hidden, and countless opportunities are missed.\n\nThrough explainable, transparent Data Science & Analytics, our consultants turn complex datasets into real business benefits, enabling you to target specific customers, assets, and activities, model specific processes, and gauge the impact of changes\n\nRelease value faster through\niterative Data Science & Analytics.\nDiscovery.\nIdentify the business value to be delivered through Data Science & Analytics, in line with strategic goals.\nProductionise.\nOptimise Data Science & Analytics models and techniques for deployment into production.\nPilot.\nPerform exploratory data analyses and create fundamental data science models to show progress and measure value.\nData expertise that's relied on by\nthe world's best-run companies. \nView all Case Studies\nBuilding a live data solution for Anglian Water's storm response.\nView Case Study\nMeet the\nAiimi experts.\n\nWe’re responsive and able to source the right team rapidly, so you get the A team every time – whether you’re facing an unprecedented event or need to jump on an opportunity. \n\nGet in touch with our Services team.\nDiscover more data solutions.\n\nData Strategy\nData Engineering\nAI Data Governance\nWorkplace AI Platform\nTalk to us about Data Science & Analytics.\n\nTo find out more about our consulting services and how we can help, just fill in the form and we'll be in touch within one working day.\n\nFirst Name*\nLast Name*\nEmail*\nPhone\nMessage\nHow did you first hear about us?\nPlease select\nSearch engine (e.g. Google, Bing)\nSocial media\nAI (ChatGPT, Copilot, Claude, etc)\nEvent or Webinar\nOnline advertisement\nNews or media article\nPodcast\nOfficial Aiimi Partner\nReview site (e.g. Gartner, G2)\nReferred by an Aiimi customer\nWord of mouth\nColleague or employer\nOther\nFrom time to time, we would like to contact you about our products, services, events and other content that we think will be of interest to you. You can unsubscribe from these communications at any time.\nYes please - I’d like to hear more from Aiimi!\nBy submitting this form you consent to us processing and storing the information you provide in accordance with our Privacy Policy\nSUBMIT"
}